{"ID":"20240220132613-vxwpo7m","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20240220132613-vxwpo7m","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240220132613-vxwpo7m\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240312165133-qi5xgm7\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240312165352-qws837o\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:2900,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240312165423-8fwb5p7\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:88,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:88\u0026#125;","title":"【小承气汤】","type":"doc","updated":"20240312165423"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240312165133-qi5xgm7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312165133-qi5xgm7","updated":"20240312165133"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"第二百二十四条。"}]},{"ID":"20240312165133-31mqm5k","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312165133-31mqm5k","updated":"20240312165133"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"原文：「阳明病」，脉迟，虽汗出，不恶寒，其身必重，短气，腹满而喘，有潮热者，此外欲解，可攻里也。手足濈然而汗出者，此大便已鞕也，「大承气汤」主之。若汗多，微发热恶寒者，外未解也，其热不潮，未可与「大承气汤」。若腹大满不通者，可与「小承气汤」，微和胃气，勿令大泄下。"}]},{"ID":"20240312165133-6e65r8q","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312165133-6e65r8q","updated":"20240312165133"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"“「阳明病」，脉迟，虽汗出，不恶寒，其身必重，短气，腹满而喘，有潮热者，此外欲解，可攻里也。”意思是说，一定要等外解掉了，再去攻里，这个是外证要解掉了，本来是恶寒现在不恶寒了，汗出了，外症还没有完全去的时候，会有身重的现象，但是他已经在出汗了，脉缓下来了，代表他自己会恢复的状态。有潮热是阳明症，前面告诉诸位太阳证要去掉了，阳明证要出来了，这个时机就可以攻里。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"如果手脚汗出，这个潮热，知道大便已经硬掉了，「大承气汤」"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。若腹大满不通者，可与「小承气汤」。"}]},{"ID":"20240312165133-orwcbrh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312165133-orwcbrh","updated":"20240312165133"}},{"ID":"20240312165133-jhx2i6b","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312165133-jhx2i6b","updated":"20240312165133"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"在介绍这一段的时候，我从金匮抓几个方子来，就会比较完整，整个消化系统你从此就不会犯错了，我现在讲的是实，没有讲热，热就是发炎，你不要胃炎，肠胃炎也拿来，不行的，不能乱攻。这是实症。在金匮里面有个处方，叫大黄甘草汤，这个使用时机是，在胃里常常会有二斗，在灵枢第三十一篇，肠胃篇里说，吃饱是下去的时候，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"胃里面是三斗二升"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，胃底下常常会有二斗，胃下方这个食物可以等七天，但是如果这个食物坏死掉了，吃到不干净食物，怎么清除它，就是大黄甘草汤，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"你怎么知道是坏死的食物？朝食暮吐"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，早上吃进去，黄昏吐出来，就代表食物在胃里面并没有消化掉。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"经方有两个地方朝食暮吐，一个是虚症，胃虚的时候，朝食暮吐，吴茱萸汤症，胃寒的时候会用到"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。这是实症，胃家实症，阳明证第一方应该是大黄甘草汤，朝食暮吐，舌苔一直是黄的，胃恶心，所以吃坏食物的时候，经方开出来的时候，就是"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"大黄甘草汤，两味药"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"而已。"}]},{"ID":"20240312165133-tnprbzz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312165133-tnprbzz","updated":"20240312165133"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"第二个才是到十二指肠这边，这个才是进入到调胃承气，调胃承气就是吐，吐不出来，幽门挡到了，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"梗到中膈的位置"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，调胃承气出现的时候，在下脘建里水分的地方一定有压痛，梗到这边，心里很难过，知道里面有东西梗到，有实的时候持续二十四小时，如果是虚的话，他就会有时候很好，有时候不好，实症梗到不管白天晚上，一直都不舒服。你问病人也问出来，你看他舌苔是黄的干的，你问他，胃痛，肚子痛是断续的痛还是持续的痛，持续的痛，结实了，因为他舌苔很黄，你摸他的脉，结实的脉很强硬。这个时候就是调胃承气。调胃承气有炙甘草，大黄，芒硝。"}]},{"ID":"20240312165133-tde80uf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312165133-tde80uf","updated":"20240312165133"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"如果到了小肠，小肠堵到，实发生在小肠里面，你怎么知道是发生在小肠里面？张仲景这里说，腹大满不通者，可与小承气汤。小承气汤是解阳明的燥矢，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"大便堵在小肠里面，病人有个主要的症状，就是排气"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，你问他便秘实不实，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"便秘肚子胀满，一直不断的放屁，因为大肠没有堵到，大肠里面是空的，堵到小肠里面，大肠空的很多气在里面，他就不断的放屁"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，这个屁是从大肠出来的。不断放屁，脉很实，舌苔很黄，又是持续的痛，你压肚子，很痛拒按，就是小承气汤。小承气汤里又大黄，厚朴，枳实。"}]},{"ID":"20240312165133-97k8mzi","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312165133-97k8mzi","updated":"20240312165133"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 第四个，如果是堵在大肠里面。"}]},{"ID":"20240312165133-bkqv2tc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312165133-bkqv2tc","updated":"20240312165133"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"5——8"}]},{"ID":"20240312165133-2smz1if","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312165133-2smz1if","updated":"20240312165133"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"也是腹满，没有大便，堵在大肠里面是用大承气汤。大承气汤又四味药，大黄、芒硝、厚朴、枳实。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"如何判断是堵在大肠里面，问病人便秘多久？七天没有大便，小便是黄的，任何的阳明燥实，小便一定是黄色的，因为燥热"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，小便很黄，屁也不放一个，这个就是大承气汤症了。因为他大便统统堵到干掉了，根本连气都排不出去了，这是大承气汤症。"}]},{"ID":"20240312165133-5r6fxe9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312165133-5r6fxe9","updated":"20240312165133"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【经方有几个地方，一个是没有放屁，屁没有了，还有如果排出来大便是像鞭子一样，原因是你的大肠有很多干燥的大便在周围，只有中间可以通过，排出来像一根长鞭一样，便如鞭，也是大承气汤症。还有一种，大便很大一个，只有旁边有一个小缝，只有水可以通过，糟粕没办法通过，这个时候，病人一天十几次下痢，你一摸肚子是硬的，你问小便是什么颜色，深黄色的，肚子拒按又非常硬，这个下痢是因为便秘引起的下痢。（堵在）大肠的时候，你在大肠的募穴"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"天枢穴"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，可以找到压痛点，小肠的话是小肠的募穴"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"关元穴"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，可以找到压痛点。所以当排气都没有了，完全堵到，大承气。大便长长一条，也是用大承气。下痢不止也是用大承气。这是几个大承气汤。】"}]},{"ID":"20240312165133-83t022z","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312165133-83t022z","updated":"20240312165133"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"如果说"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"大便是梗到阑尾"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"了，你怎么知道他梗在这个地方？急性盲肠炎发的时候，因为"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"盲肠刚好足阳明胃经经过这个地方，有盲肠炎出现脚会弓起来，右脚弓起来会比较舒服"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，所以他来看你的时候，右脚是弓到的。他右脚弓起来，肚子痛会减缓，缓冲一下，你压他足三里下一寸，阑尾穴，阑尾穴压到，他有压痛，再加上他脚弓起来比较舒服，我们就很肯定他是盲肠炎。这个时候用"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"大黄牡丹皮汤"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。经方拿到手上，不要担心不要怕，一定要有信心。你说，老师西医说肠破裂化脓就死人了，很危险，还是给西医开刀。不要，盲肠还是有用的，介绍金匮会讲，虽然小小一段盲肠，还是很管用的。大黄牡丹皮汤专门清这个阑尾发炎的地方。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"阑尾发炎大部分痛在孕妇"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，有的还痛在左边，脚还是弓到，脚弓到是一样的。大黄牡丹皮汤重用大黄，一剂下去全部清出来了。“老师，如果太慢了？嘭，破掉了，我怎么知道，他破掉了？”很简单，原来他肿胀堵到里面，不断的痛，不断的加强，瞬间他痛去掉了，不痛了，你摸他这个地方，非常的烫，其他都是冰的，你知道他破裂了，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"破裂转腹膜炎"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，你如果给西医治疗，不断的用抗生素。中医这个就不用大黄了，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"用当归赤豆散"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，就当归跟赤小豆两味药，你用当归赤豆散的时候，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"赤小豆一定要发芽"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，所以我们平常把赤小豆发一些牙放到那边冷藏，预备一些。发芽的赤小豆我随时准备着。只要他发芽发的跟豆芽一样，就给他冷冻那边。当归赤小豆，赤小豆一定要发芽的。当归赤豆散不单单用到肠子破裂，胆如果胆结石堵到，里面胆囊破裂的时候一样的症状，本来是剧痛，瞬间痛去掉了。破裂以后腹膜会把它包住，他不会散乱，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"为什么赤小豆发牙才会好，取他的药性，本来是一根，破裂以后，腹膜把它包住是这个形状，赤小豆发芽后一根一根可以伸到很深的地方去"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。当归赤小豆就两味药，不用煮，当归跟赤小豆打在一起，粘哒哒的就吃下去，跟生菜沙拉，效果非常好，吃下去他就可以动，原来不能动，他躺到那不动就不痛，一动就痛，因为腹膜炎。"}]},{"ID":"20240312165133-bc04486","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312165133-bc04486","updated":"20240312165133"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"还有一个情形，妈妈回家，儿子躲到哪吓她，有的人是发奔豚，有的不是，大便梗到这边，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"大肠这边有一个血管，直接络到肝脏"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，一紧张，干燥的大便顶到血管这边来，当干燥大便顶到（肝脏）这边，有一个特殊的症状会出现，叫"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"肠子中间有水气"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。病人便秘，这个地方痛，你压他肚子，一压咕噜咕噜水声很多，不是大承气，也不是小承气，这是受惊吓发的，用"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"己椒苈黄丸"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，防己、椒目、葶苈子、大黄，做成丸剂，外面三钱的芒硝在汤里面，丸剂吞下去，芒硝汤冲下去，把这个大便打掉。一打掉整个大便大下。但是这个一定要用丸剂。"}]},{"ID":"20240312165133-q6y7sad","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312165133-q6y7sad","updated":"20240312165133"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"当你堵在大肠里面，兼有恶心的时候，就是大柴胡汤症"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，阳明症不会有恶心。大柴胡汤会用大黄，什么时候会柴胡汤加芒硝，就是屁都不放一个，就要加芒硝，这个知道燥矢的大便梗到大肠里面了，梗到直肠那边了。"}]},{"ID":"20240312165133-vpk68ca","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312165133-vpk68ca","updated":"20240312165133"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"还有一种情况也是用丸剂，他跟小承气互为表里，小肠堵到的时候，小肠津液没有了，我们用小承气，还有一种是"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"脾约"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"麻子仁丸症"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，麻子仁丸症是小肠堵到，小肠比较小，一节一节，大便堵到排出一粒一粒的，麻子仁丸症大便像羊便一颗颗排出来，这就是麻子仁丸症。你用麻子仁汤不行，必须要用麻子仁丸，丸剂下去，这个能够增润津液，大便排出就正常了。中医光是一个便秘肠胃就分这么多处方，实症，燥矢的话就是这样子，全部是用大黄。这样就不会辩证错误。至于剂量多少，后面会介绍。"}]},{"ID":"20240312165133-qave63t","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312165133-qave63t","updated":"20240312165133"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"如果你很了解这个病，你把病挡在这个肠子里面，病在阳明就走掉了，病就不会传。"}]},{"ID":"20240312165133-as8q885","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312165133-as8q885","updated":"20240312165133"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"还有一种不是用大黄，堵在盲肠这个地方，大肠头这边"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，这个病人陈述，大肠盲肠这边，很多食物堵在这边，压这里会痛，这一块地方出现问题就是"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"薏苡附子败酱散"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，这个是在金匮里面。病人右下腹痛，不是很强的痛，隐隐作痛，也是拒按，你问他用不用脚弓到比较舒服，他不用，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"薏苡附子败酱散专门清大肠头这一块的东西"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"这一块破裂堵到的时候，手上左手的生命线有一个开心果那么大的紫斑。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240312165133-f20ca35","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312165133-f20ca35","updated":"20240312165133"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"只要是实症，都是持续的痛，不会断续的痛实症出现的时候，病人是拒按。实症出现病人会比较阳亢，讲话声音比较大，比较烦躁焦虑，睡不好。阴证出现的时候，比较缓慢，沉静。"}]},{"ID":"20240312165133-qf1izfi","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312165133-qf1izfi","updated":"20240312165133"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"小承气没有芒硝，调胃承气和大承气有用芒硝，大黄甘草汤也没有芒硝。攻下的药最强的就是大承气汤。芒硝不单单是攻坚硬的大便，芒硝攻肿块，积聚，癌症肿瘤都可以攻。炎症脓痒化脓积水统统可以使用芒硝。使用芒硝跟大黄的时候，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"芒硝都不煮很久"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，煮芒硝成盐巴了，完全没有攻下的力量。中药生用的时候比较强。"}]},{"ID":"20240312165133-fswgh6f","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312165133-fswgh6f","style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);","updated":"20240312165133"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"parent-style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);","style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"调胃承气汤方"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\" parent-style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240312165133-fhgqbh3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312165133-fhgqbh3","style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);","updated":"20240312165133"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"parent-style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);","style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"大黄四两去皮，清酒洗。甘草二两炙，芒硝半斤。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\" parent-style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240312165133-bs3yptr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312165133-bs3yptr","style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);","updated":"20240312165133"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"parent-style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);","style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"右三味，以水三升，煮取一升，去滓，纳芒硝，更上火微煮令沸，少少温服之。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\" parent-style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240312165133-d0w0cri","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312165133-d0w0cri","updated":"20240312165133"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"大黄四钱，用清酒洗，你不要真的酒洗，意思是泡一下酒就可以了。大黄酒洗过后药性比较缓，甘草两钱，芒硝一般两钱。煮的时候，先煮甘草，大黄，最后再放芒硝，稍微煮一下让芒硝能化 掉。单味大黄非常好用，没事眼白忽然血出来，或者没事流鼻血，上焦比较热的时候，用大黄泡茶，很快就消掉了。"}]},{"ID":"20240312165133-yrsbfiz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312165133-yrsbfiz","style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);","updated":"20240312165133"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"parent-style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);","style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"小承气汤方"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\" parent-style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240312165133-3pf3a32","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312165133-3pf3a32","style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);","updated":"20240312165133"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"parent-style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);","style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"大黄四两酒洗。厚朴二两炙去皮。枳实三枚大者，炙。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\" parent-style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240312165133-zi3pc0n","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312165133-zi3pc0n","style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);","updated":"20240312165133"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"parent-style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);","style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"右三味，以水四升，煮取一升二合，去滓，分温二服，当更衣；不尔者，尽饮之；若更衣者，勿服之。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\" parent-style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240312165133-ym1fig5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312165133-ym1fig5","updated":"20240312165133"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"大黄四钱。厚朴两钱。枳实三钱两钱都可以，枳实就是橘子，小橘子，淮河以北产的橘子叫枳实，淮河以南叫橘子，枳实小小的像金桔一样。厚朴是取树的皮，本来厚朴是生的，炙过干掉，二两比较轻。主力还是大黄。"}]},{"ID":"20240312165133-heie6q6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312165133-heie6q6","updated":"20240312165133"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"我介绍的阳明实症里面用的大黄，其他地方我们也会用到大黄，因为不在这个篇里面，就不讲了。"}]},{"ID":"20240312165133-2x3z495","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312165133-2x3z495","updated":"20240312165133"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"现在主要讲阳明热实，肠胃的燥实为主，才会有一系列肠胃从胃到肛门口大便怎么出去。"}]},{"ID":"20240312165133-p5gow74","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312165133-p5gow74","updated":"20240312165133"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"临床上很多地方在使用大承气汤。我们也曾经用过梅毒，病人来的时候，西医讲的梅毒，可他陈述出来七天不大便了，屁也不放一个，小便很黄，大承气攻下去，梅毒也好了。所以我常跟诸位说，要离，离卦，中间是虚的，心里面要不着相，不要被病名绑住。"}]},{"ID":"20240312165134-s4x47y2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312165134-s4x47y2"}},{"ID":"20240312165106-1mo6g0x","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312165106-1mo6g0x","updated":"20240312165106"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"第二百二十五条。"}]},{"ID":"20240312165106-m0lnywx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312165106-m0lnywx","updated":"20240312165106"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"原文：「阳明病」，潮热、大便已鞕者，可与「大承气汤」；不鞕者，不可与之。若不大便六七日，恐有燥屎，欲知之法，少与「小承气汤」，汤入腹中，转矢气者，此有燥屎，乃可攻之，若不转矢气者，此但初头鞕，后必溏，不可攻之，攻之必胀满，不能食也，欲饮水者，与水则哕。"}]},{"ID":"20240312165106-tgddjld","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312165106-tgddjld","updated":"20240312165106"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"「阳明病」，潮热，潮热就是一阵一阵的热，阳明病潮热一定在黄昏的时候。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"阳明证有两个，一个时候腑实，一个是经热。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"承气汤症就是腑实，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"腑就是胃胆大肠小肠膀胱此类，经热就是在阳明经上的燥热"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"经热是白虎汤症"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。阳明讲的就是白虎和承气。承气会用到大黄和芒硝，白虎汤会用到石膏。"}]},{"ID":"20240312165106-zyyltzx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312165106-zyyltzx","updated":"20240312165106"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"潮热的时候病人有壮热，壮热就是发高烧，你只有两剂。一个是大便的燥矢造成的高热，还有一个是大便很通畅，经热也会有壮热。所以你只要确定他有没有大便，如果实在不知道看小便。经热的话小便是白的，腑热大便燥结在那边，小便是黄的。承气汤症小便是很深黄的。或者他一直在放屁，小承气汤。你只要确定他是承气汤症，快下，一剂就够了。"}]},{"ID":"20240312165106-30d8vmg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312165106-30d8vmg","updated":"20240312165106"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"“大便已鞕者，可与「大承气汤」；不鞕者，不可与之。”你确定他是大承气汤症，你只有大承气唯一处方，不要再去考虑其他了，大承气汤完全不放屁。"}]},{"ID":"20240312165106-tbv4adk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312165106-tbv4adk","updated":"20240312165106"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"“若不大便六七日，恐有燥屎，欲知之法，少与「小承气汤」，汤入腹中，转矢气（放屁）者，此有燥屎，乃可攻之，若不转矢气（放屁）者，此但初头鞕，后必溏，不可攻之，攻之必胀满，”这里告诉你，你如果开的不是大承气，开的是小承气，大便没出来，一直在放屁，你知道错了，大承气汤。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"真正临床你只要问他有没有屁，没屁就是大承气讲完了"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"阳明燥热一定是舌头很黄，严重的话很黑，而且很干"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。黑有两种，一种舌苔，很寒，寒到极寒的时候舌苔也是黑色的，但是这个黑有润泽有津液。大承气汤那个黑根本就是干掉了，一摸脉脉跳的很大很数，再一摸额头，全身发烫的，眼睛都往上翻的。"}]},{"ID":"20240312165106-zb733yt","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312165106-zb733yt","updated":"20240312165106"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" ‘若不转矢气者，此但初头鞕，后必溏，不可攻之，攻之必胀满，不能食也，欲饮水者，与水则哕。’这个症状，前面是硬的后面是溏，代笔这个人肚子里面是寒湿的，大承气汤有大黄芒硝都是寒凉的药，本来已经溏了，溏就是有寒湿在里面，寒凉药再下去会加重，所以攻之胀满，不能吃东西了，欲饮水者，与水则哕。他想喝水，胃里面太冷了，喝水下去就打嗝。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"严重的话可以用茯苓四逆汤"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。如果攻下去他只是"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"气很多，肚子胀满，排气很多，用厚朴生姜半夏人参甘草汤"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，如果是人体虚掉了以后，人非常虚，或者被你攻下，你也可以用理中汤。甚至他说胃口没了，吃东西都不能吃了，小建中汤也可以，小建中汤里面重用白芍。"}]},{"ID":"20240312165106-3l23xck","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312165106-3l23xck","updated":"20240312165106"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"打嗝很严重，但是你不能看到打嗝就不治了。中医经常说，男怕脚肿，女怕头肿。不能说很危险不治了。"}]},{"ID":"20240312165423-89y9obq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312165423-89y9obq"}},{"ID":"20240312165423-aiywo6l","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312165423-aiywo6l","updated":"20240312165423"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"第二百三十条。"}]},{"ID":"20240312165423-ajz2isp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312165423-ajz2isp","updated":"20240312165423"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"原文：「阳明病」，其人多汗，以津液外出，胃中燥，大便必鞕，鞕则谵语，「小承气汤」主之。若一服谵语止，更莫再服。"}]},{"ID":"20240312165423-8fwb5p7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312165423-8fwb5p7","updated":"20240312165423"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"胃中燥，包括肠，不单单是胃。大承气跟小承气的区分就是，小承气有放屁，大承气没有屁，小承气在腹部的胀满。大承气在天枢穴会找到压痛点。两个都有燥矢在里面，但是一个是小肠一个是大肠。"}]},{"ID":"20240312165107-2mpx0tj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312165107-2mpx0tj"}},{"ID":"20240312165053-ht488lc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312165053-ht488lc","updated":"20240312165053"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"第二百三十一条。"}]},{"ID":"20240312165053-yh96zww","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312165053-yh96zww","updated":"20240312165053"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"原文：「阳明病」，谵语，发潮热，脉滑而虚者，「小承气汤」主之，因与「承气汤」一升，汤入腹中转矢气者，更服一升；若不转矢气，勿更与之。明日不大便，脉反微涩者，裹虚者，为难治，不可更与「承气汤」也。"}]},{"ID":"20240312165053-11nttqg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312165053-11nttqg","updated":"20240312165053"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"“脉滑而虚者”病人应该是脉实的，结果病人脉滑虚，虚脉就是你按下去脉就没有了，这种情况用小承气汤轻轻攻一下就好了。"}]},{"ID":"20240312165053-ifyi60n","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312165053-ifyi60n","updated":"20240312165053"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"这个条辨是当你看到病人大便不出来的时候，承气汤下去，大便没有排出来，就不要给他了，等下看看情形。隔天还是没有大便，摸他的脉，里虚了，只是难治而已，不是不治。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"可以把里虚补足，用一些补阴的药"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，不要再给他承气汤了，里虚再给承气汤会更虚。"}]},{"ID":"20240312165411-2dfochc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312165411-2dfochc"}},{"ID":"20240312165411-i4sofd4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312165411-i4sofd4","updated":"20240312165411"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"第二百三十二、二百三十三条放在一起。"}]},{"ID":"20240312165411-eipgjq2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312165411-eipgjq2","updated":"20240312165411"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"原文：「阳明病」，谵语，有潮热，反不能食者，宜「大承气汤」下之，胃中必有燥屎五六枚也；若能食者，但鞕耳，宜「小承气汤」。"}]},{"ID":"20240312165411-uiqzg4p","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312165411-uiqzg4p","updated":"20240312165411"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"这个条辨是用能吃和不能吃决定是给大承气还是小承气。这样子也可以作为诊断依据。"}]},{"ID":"20240312165411-b42q8m5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312165411-b42q8m5","updated":"20240312165411"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"不能吃东西大承气，肠胃堵到了，干燥大便往回逆，不想吃东西。"}]},{"ID":"20240312165411-6drlau4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312165411-6drlau4","updated":"20240312165411"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"有胃口，小承气，没胃口，大承气，因为大承气的症状比小承气严重很多。"}]},{"ID":"20240312165359-5oaepip","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312165359-5oaepip"}},{"ID":"20240312165400-ynfh3oe","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312165400-ynfh3oe","updated":"20240312165400"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"第二百六十五条。"}]},{"ID":"20240312165400-jlr2qqq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312165400-jlr2qqq","updated":"20240312165400"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"原文：「太阳病」，若吐，若下，若发汗，微烦、小便数，大便因鞕者，与「小承气汤」。"}]},{"ID":"20240312165400-zr3vyx2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312165400-zr3vyx2","updated":"20240312165400"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 还是太阳病，你什么都用了，结果病人还是大便排不出来，这个时候就是小承气汤，如果光是吐就是调胃承气。如果说汗发太多了，可能就是大承气了。"}]},{"ID":"20240312165351-9mv4x4n","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312165351-9mv4x4n"}},{"ID":"20240312165352-xu5dry2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312165352-xu5dry2","updated":"20240312165352"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"第二百六十六条。"}]},{"ID":"20240312165352-17tldj7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312165352-17tldj7","updated":"20240312165352"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"原文：得病二三日，脉弱，无「太阳柴胡证」，烦躁，心下鞭，至四五日，虽能食，以「小承气汤」少少与微和之，令小安。至五六日，舆「小承气汤」一升。若不大便，小便少者。虽不能食，但初头鞕，后必溏，未定成鞕，攻之必溏。须小便利，矢定鞕，乃可攻之，宜「大承气汤」。"}]},{"ID":"20240312165352-aqm5vqd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312165352-aqm5vqd","updated":"20240312165352"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"无「太阳柴胡证」，表症，怕风恶寒，体重节痛，有汗、发烧项强都没有，柴胡的往来寒热、胸胁苦满、恶心都没有。"}]},{"ID":"20240312165352-67skkd1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312165352-67skkd1","updated":"20240312165352"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"腹中湿很盛的时候，攻下的时候，张仲景的意思是要等，怎么知道湿很盛？第一个腹满，第二个，大便是溏泻，比较软比较稀。张仲景意思是，等他湿小便排利出来，等他大便完全称为干燥的时候，乃可攻。用大承气汤。"}]},{"ID":"20240312165352-qbxurue","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312165352-qbxurue","updated":"20240312165352"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"我们是否真的需要等它呢？不需要等。我们有很多处方可以治疗他，比如说我们知道他有湿，加些去湿的药让他小便利出来，可以用五苓散，五苓散可以利湿，但是病人"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"一定要有小便不利，口渴"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"的现象，用五苓散。五苓散配合承气汤一起就可以使用。"}]},{"ID":"20240312165352-62sod8d","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312165352-62sod8d","updated":"20240312165352"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"伤寒论的条辨是很死的，临床上用的时候是很活。你只要记得，大承气汤是用在纯燥矢的时候，完全没有其他的副症在里面，如过有其他的症状，里面有湿，大便还没有结硬，还有溏的时候，光是大承气下，张仲景不赞成，因为还没有纯阳明症，那你要用利湿的方法，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"去湿的方法就是利小便，除非湿在关节的时候，用汗解来去湿"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，否则的话都是利小便。"}]},{"ID":"20240312165352-pbhngvz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312165352-pbhngvz","updated":"20240312165352"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"中医治病汗吐下法。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"下法分两个"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，一个是"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"攻大便"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，一个是"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"攻小便"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。在"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"阳症的时候，攻大便是最快的。当阴证才会去利小便"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"所以不管是实脾饮，分消汤，或者是补气建中汤，都是去利湿，利小便出来"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，所以在阴证一般都会去利小便，很少去利大便。阳症的时候利大便。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"利小便的力量没有利大便那么好，所以能够把病阻止在阳明证的时候，通大便的药会比利小便的药来的快，几乎无所不通"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。小便就不见的利出来了，因为他是阴证。"}]},{"ID":"20240312165352-qws837o","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312165352-qws837o"}}]}